<header><p class="enc-kicker">Event · other</p><h1 class="enc-title">Soviet declaration of war on Japan</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1945</span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a> · Also known as Soviet declaration of war</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Soviet declaration of war on <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/japan">Japan</a> was made in August 1945, followed by a rapid Soviet invasion of Japanese-held <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/manchuria">Manchuria</a>. Coming alongside the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/atomic-bombings-of-hiroshima-and-nagasaki">atomic bombings</a>, it removed Japan's hope of Soviet mediation. The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/empire-of-japan">Empire of Japan</a> profile treats it as a factor in Japan's decision to surrender in 1945.</p></div>
